@startuml
title D-01 Assisted Payment Terminal Context Diagram

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor "Parker" as Parker
actor "Cashier" as Cashier
actor "Supervisor" as Supervisor

component "Assisted Payment Terminal\nhardened terminal app family" as APT
component "Central PMS\npayment finality + control state" as Central
component "Central PMS /\nDiscount workflow" as Discount
component "Payment Orchestrator /\napproved payment integration" as Pay
component "Vendor PMS / HCP\nnormal session + tariff authority" as Vendor
component "Resolved Site POS Server\nSales Invoice issuer" as POS
component "Operator Console\nnon-payment governance" as Console
component "Gate / Exit System\nExitAuthorization consumer" as Gate

Parker --> Cashier : assisted payment request
Cashier --> APT : terminal workflow
Supervisor --> Console : review / approval
APT --> Central : session lookup, payable basis,\npayment and authorization status
APT --> Discount : statutory validation request
Central --> Vendor : normal session / tariff resolve
Central --> Pay : payment attempt
Pay --> Central : verified provider outcome
Central --> POS : fiscal issuance request\nfor resolved Site
POS --> Central : Sales Invoice identity / status
Central --> Gate : ExitAuthorization
APT --> Console : supervisor escalation context

note right of APT
Does not declare payment finality.
Does not issue ExitAuthorization.
Does not own discount policy.
Does not act as independent fiscal authority.
end note

@enduml
